From: leow149 <leow149@lucidmail.xyz>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 12:58:36 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 074/100] dt-bindings: vendor-prefixes: Add TrimUI

TrimUI makes handheld game consoles, e.g. the Smart Pro. Add the vendor
prefix for the board and gamepad bindings that follow.

Assisted-by: Claude Opus 5.5
Signed-off-by: leow149 <leow149@lucidmail.xyz>
---
 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/vendor-prefixes.yaml | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/vendor-prefixes.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/vendor-prefixes.yaml
index ba2002969..a5e32e4bf 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/vendor-prefixes.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/vendor-prefixes.yaml
@@ -1759,6 +1759,8 @@ patternProperties:
     description: Transpeed
   "^traverse,.*":
     description: Traverse Technologies Australia Pty Ltd
+  "^trimui,.*":
+    description: TrimUI
   "^tronfy,.*":
     description: Tronfy
   "^tronsmart,.*":
